#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kab; (&kde; Address book) is a simple address book for &kde;."
msgstr "&kab; (&kde;'s adressebog) er en simpel adresse bog for &kde;."

#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>Kab</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>Kab</keyword>"

#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "kdeutils"
msgstr "kdeutils"

#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "address book"
msgstr "adressebog"

#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Indledning"

#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kab; is an address book for use with &kde; that lets you save names, "
"postal, email, talk and <acronym>WWW</acronym>"
" addresses, telephone numbers, important dates and other information in a "
"card index form."
msgstr ""
"&kab; er en adressebog til brug med &kde; der lader dig gemme navne-, post-, "
"e-mail-, talk- og <acronym>WWW</acronym> adresser, telefonnumre, vigtige "
"datoer og anden information i en kortindekde-form."

#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kab;"
msgstr "Brug af &kab;"

#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering Data"
msgstr "Indtastning af data"

#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can import address book data from the &kde; 1 version of &kab; or from "
"&Netscape; by using the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Import</guisubmenu>"
"</menuchoice> menu option."
msgstr ""
"Du kan importeret adressebogsdata fra &kde; 1 udgaven af &kab; eller fra "
"&Netscape; ved brug af "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Fil</guimenu><guisubmenu>Importér</guisubmenu>"
"</menuchoice>-menuvalget."

#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also add individual entries by choosing the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add "
"Entry...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option, which brings up the following "
"dialog box:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan også tilføje individuelle indgange ved at gøre "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Redigér</guimenu><guimenuitem>Tilføj "
"indgang...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>-valget, hvilket får følgende "
"dialogboks frem:"

#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's another screen-shot of &kab;"
msgstr "Her er et andet skærmbillede af &kab;"

#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kab; in edit view mode"
msgstr "&kab; i redigeringsvisning-tilstand"

#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This view is used to add or change the details for a card. It has four main "
"tab pages; <guilabel>Person</guilabel>, <guilabel>Telephone</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Address</guilabel> and <guilabel>Birthday</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Denne visning bruges til at tilføje eller ændre detaljerne i et kort. Den "
"har fire hoved-fanebladssider; <guilabel>Person</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Telefon</guilabel>, <guilabel>Adresse</guilabel> og "
"<guilabel>Fødselsdag</guilabel>."

#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Person</guilabel> tab page is where you enter the person's "
"name and email and Talk addresses and any associated &URL;s. Whatever you "
"enter in the <guilabel>Formatted name:</guilabel> text box will appear as "
"the entry's name in the entry navigation list, the Toolbar Drop Down list "
"and at the top left of the card. If you do not enter anything in the "
"<guilabel>Formatted name:</guilabel> text box then &kab; will automatically "
"generate a formatted name such as <quote>Holmes, Sherlock</quote>."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Person</guilabel>-fanbladssiden er hvor du indtaster personens "
"navn og e-mail- og Talk-adresser og tilknyttede &URL;'er. Det du indtaster i "
"<guilabel>Formateret navn:</guilabel> tekstboksen vil vise sig som "
"indgangens navn i indgangsnavigerings-listen, værktøjslinjens "
"drop-ned-liste og for oven til venstre på kortet. Hvis du ikke indtaster "
"noget i <guilabel>Formateret navn:</guilabel>-tekstbokse, så vil &kab; "
"automatisk generere et formateret navn såsom <quote>Holmes, "
"Sherlock</quote>."

#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Telephone</guilabel> tab page is, obviously, where you enter "
"the telephone number(s)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Telefon</guilabel>-fanebladssidener, naturligvis stedet hvor du "
"indtaster telefonnumrene."

#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Addresses</guilabel> tab page lets you enter one or more "
"addresses for this entry."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Adresser</guilabel>-fanebladssiden lader dig indtaste én eller "
"adresser for denne indgang."

#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each address you want to enter, click on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> "
"button. It will display a drop down list containing the address types you "
"have set up with the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure this "
"file...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option. Choose one and it will appear in "
"the <guilabel>Address types</guilabel> text box where you can edit it if "
"required."
msgstr ""
"For hver adresse du ønsker at indtaste, klik på "
"<guibutton>Tilføj</guibutton>-knappen. Den vil vise en drop-ned-liste der "
"indeholder de adressetyper du har sat op med "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Redigér</guimenu><guimenuitem>Indstil denne "
"fil...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>-valget. Vælg én og den vil vise sig i "
"<guilabel>Adressetyper</guilabel>-tekstboksen hvor du kan redigere den hvis "
"det kræves."

#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Then fill in the address details."
msgstr "Udfyld så adressens detaljer."

#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing the <guibutton>Organization...</guibutton>"
" button brings up another dialog box where you can enter details of any "
"organization that the person works for and his position within it. However, "
"the current version of &kab; does not display this information in the "
"<guimenuitem>Business Card</guimenuitem> view."
msgstr ""
"Ved at trykke på <guibutton>Organisation...</guibutton>-knappen får du en "
"anden dialogboks frem hvor du kan indtaste detaljer om den organisation "
"personen arbejder for og hans position indenfor den. I den nuværende udgave "
"af &kab; vises denne information imidlertid ikke i "
"<guimenuitem>Forretningskort</guimenuitem>-visningen."

#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Birthday</guilabel>"
" tab page is where you select a significant date to appear at the top right "
"of the card view. It will only appear if you have checked the <guilabel>I "
"know this person's birthday:</guilabel> box."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Fødselsdag</guilabel>"
"-fanebladssiden er stedet hvor du vælger en vigtig dato der skal vises "
"foroven til højre i kortet. Det vil kun være der hvis du har afkrydset "
"<guilabel>Jeg kender denne persons fødsesdag:</guilabel>-boksen."

#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will probably need to experiment with your entries in the "
"<guilabel>Person</guilabel> and <guilabel>Addresses</guilabel> tab pages to "
"get the kind of result you want in the Card view."
msgstr ""
"Du vil formodentlig skulle eksperimentere med dine indgange i "
"<guilabel>Person</guilabel>- og "
"<guilabel>Addresser</guilabel>-fanebladssiderne for at få det resultat du "
"ønsker i kortvisningen."

#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two other tab pages in this dialog box which may be useful in some "
"circumstances:"
msgstr ""
"Der er to andre fanebladssider i denne dialogboks som kan være nyttige "
"under visse omstændigheder:"

#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Comment</guilabel> page. Any text you enter here will not "
"appear in the <guimenuitem>Business Card</guimenuitem> view but will be "
"included when you print out the card details."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kommentar</guilabel>-siden. Den tekst du indtaster her vil ikke "
"ses i <guimenuitem>Forretningskort</guimenuitem>-visningen men vil være "
"inkluderet når du udskriver kortets detaljer."

#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>User fields</guilabel> page. This lets you add information to "
"the database file with user defined fields and data. This data is not shown "
"in the <guimenuitem>Business Card</guimenuitem>"
" view, nor is it printed out, but could be read by another program."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Brugerfelter</guilabel>-siden. Den lader dig tilføje information "
"til databasefilen med brugerdefinerede felter og data. Disse data vises ikke "
"i <guimenuitem>Forretningskort</guimenuitem>"
"visningen, og bliver heller ikke udskrevet, men kan nemt læses af et andet "
"program."

#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "Viewing Data"
msgstr "Vise data"

#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kab; has two basic views, <guimenuitem>Business Card</guimenuitem> and "
"<guimenuitem>Editing</guimenuitem>. You can switch between them with the "
"<guimenu>View</guimenu> menu. The screen-shot below shows the "
"<guimenuitem>Business Card</guimenuitem> view."
msgstr ""
"&kab; har to basale visninger, <guimenuitem>Forretningskort</guimenuitem>"
" og <guimenuitem>Redigering</guimenuitem>. Du kan skifte mellem dem med "
"<guimenu>Vis</guimenu>-menuen. Skærmaftrykket nedenfor viser "
"<guimenuitem>Forretningskort</guimenuitem>visningen."

#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screen-shot of &kab;"
msgstr "Her er et et skærmbillede af &kab;"

#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kab; in card view mode"
msgstr "&kab; i kortvisningstilstand"

#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This view lets you search for an entry in &kab;'s database and see the "
"information held for that entry."
msgstr ""
"Denne visning lader dig søge efter en indgang i &kab;'s database og se den "
"information der holdes for den indgang."

#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a particular entry you can pick it from the Drop Down box in the "
"Toolbar or the entry navigation list, or you can step through the entries "
"using the <guiicon>large Toolbar arrows</guiicon> or with your keyboard "
"arrow keys."
msgstr ""
"For at vælge en bestemt indgang kan du tage den fra drop-ned-boksen i "
"værktøjslinjen eller indgangs-navigeringslisten, eller du kan gå gennem "
"indgangene ved hjælp af de <guiicon>store værktøjslinjepile</guiicon> "
"eller med dit tastaturs piletaster."

#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also search the database for a particular entry by using the <link "
"linkend=\"kab-edit-menu\"><menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>"
"Search entries...</guimenuitem></menuchoice></link>"
" option or by entering an email address, first name or last name into the "
"text box at the top of the entry navigation list."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også gennemsøge database for en bestemt indgang ved at bruge <link "
"linkend=\"kab-edit-menu\"><menuchoice><guimenu>Redigér</guimenu>"
"<guimenuitem>Søg indgange...</guimenuitem></menuchoice></link>-tilvalget "
"eller ved at indtaste en e-mail-adresse, fornavnet eller efternavnet i "
"tekstboksen for oveni indgangs-navigeringslisten."

#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the top of the main card area you can see the name as it appears in the "
"Toolbar Drop Down box list, and possibly an important date such as the "
"person's Birthday."
msgstr ""
"For oven af hovedkort-området kan du se navnet som det ser ud i "
"værktøjlinjens drop-ned-liste, og muligvis en vigtig dato såsom personens "
"fødselsdag."

#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An address will be shown in the middle of the card. &kab; lets you enter "
"more than one address, for - say - Home, Work and Holiday Dacha. The Drop "
"Down box above the address then lets you select which of these is displayed."
msgstr ""
"En adresse vil blive vist i midten af kortet. &kab; lader dig indtaste mere "
"end én adresse, for - for eksempel - hjem, arbejde og feriebolig. "
"Drop-ned-boksen ovenfor adressen lader dig så vælge hvilken af disse der "
"vises."

#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The bottom of the card shows email addresses, &URL;s and telephone numbers. "
"Left click on the email address to send an email, on the &URL; to open a "
"browser window. If you have entered more than one email address or &URL;, "
"then only one will be displayed on the card followed by [..] and when you "
"click on it a little dialog box will appear so that you can choose the "
"address you want."
msgstr ""
"Bunden af kortet viser e-mail-adresser, &URL;er og telefonnumre. Venstreklik "
"på e-mail-adressen for at send en email, på &URL;'en for at åbne et "
"netsøgervindue. Hvis du har indtastet mere end én e-mail-adresse eller "
"&URL;, så er det  kun én der vil blive vist på kortet fulgt af [..] og "
"når du klikker på den vil en lille dialogboks komme frem så du kan vælge "
"den adresse du ønsker."

#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <link linkend=\"kab-file-menu\"><guimenu>File</guimenu></link> menu has "
"options allowing you to create and use more than one database, import your "
"old &kde; 1 or &Netscape; address book, or print one or all entries."
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"kab-file-menu\"><guimenu>Fil</guimenu></link>-menuen har "
"tilvalg der tillader dig at lave og bruge mere end én database, importere "
"dine gamle &kde; 1 eller &Netscape; adressebøger eller udskrive en eller "
"alle indgange."

#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "Kommandoreference"

#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Menu bar"
msgstr "Menulinjen"

#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>File</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Fil</guimenu>menuen"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Create New "
"Database...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Opret ny "
"database...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this if you want to create another &kab; address book database so that "
"you can keep separate address books for, say, business and personal contacts."
msgstr ""
"Brug dette hvis du ønsker at lave en anden &kab;-adressebogsdatabase så du "
"kan have separate adressebøger for, for eksempel, forretnings- og "
"personlige kontakter."

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Åbn...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Open</action> a &kab; database. This menu choice is used to open a "
"new address book that you have created."
msgstr ""
"<action>Åbn</action>"
" en &kab;-database. Dette menu-valg bruges til at åbne en ny adressebog som "
"du har lavet."

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open Default Database</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Åbn standarddatabase</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Opens the default</action> &kab; database."
msgstr "<action>Åbner standard</action>-&kab;-databasen."

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Gem</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Save</action> the current &kab; database."
msgstr "<action>Gem</action> til den aktuelle &kab;-database."

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Import</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>KDE 1 "
"Address Book</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Importér</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>"
"KDE 1 adressebog</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lets you <action>import an address book</action> generated by version 1 of "
"&kab;, changing its format to that used by version 2, and saving it with a "
"different name. Doing this does not destroy the original address book."
msgstr ""
"Lader dig <action>importere en adressebog</action>"
" genereret af version 1 af &kab;, idet formatet ændres til det der bruges "
"af 2, og gemme den med et andet navn. På denne måde ødelægges den "
"oprindelige adressebog ikke."

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Import</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Netscape Address Book</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Importér</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Netscape-adressebog</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets you <action>import an address book</action> generated by &Netscape;."
msgstr "Lader dig <action>importere en adressebog</action> genereret af &Netscape;."

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>T</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Print</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Print Entry...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>T</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Udskriv</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Udskriv indgang...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "To print out all details of the current entry."
msgstr "For at udskrive alle detaljer i den aktuelle indgang."

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Print</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Print Entries...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Udskriv</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Udskriv indgange...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "To print out all details of all entries in the database."
msgstr "For at udskrive alle detaljer i databasen."

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Fil</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Afslut</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kab;."
msgstr "<action>Afslutter</action> &kab;."

#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Redigerings</guimenu>menuen"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Entry...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tilføj "
"indgang...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Add a new entry to the address book</action>. This does the same as "
"using the Toolbar <guiicon>New entry</guiicon> icon."
msgstr ""
"<action>Tilføj en ny indgang til adressebogen</action>. Dette gør det "
"samme som at bruge værktøjslinjens <guiicon>Nu indgang</guiicon>-ikon."

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Edit entry...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Redigér "
"indgang...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are in Business card view you can use this menu item (or the Toolbar "
"<guiicon>Edit Entry...</guiicon> icon) when you want to <action>edit the "
"current entry</action>, rather than changing to "
"<guimenuitem>Editing</guimenuitem> view with the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Editing</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice> menu choice."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du er i forretningskort-visningen, kan du bruge dette menu-punkt (eller "
"værktøjslinjens <guiicon>Redigér indgang...</guiicon>-ikon) når du "
"ønsker at <action>redigere den aktuelle indgang</action>, snarere end at "
"skifte til <guimenuitem>Redigerings</guimenuitem>visningen med "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Vis</guimenu><guimenuitem>Redigering</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice>-menuvalget."

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Remove Entry</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Fjern "
"indgang</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove the current entry from the database."
msgstr "Fjern den aktuelle indgang fra databasen."

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Send an Email</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Send en "
"e-mail</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Does the same as <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> clicking on the "
"<guilabel>Email</guilabel> line at the bottom of the Business card."
msgstr ""
"Gør det samme som <mousebutton>venstre</mousebutton>klik på "
"<guilabel>E-mail</guilabel>-linjen for neden på forretningskortet."

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>B</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Browse</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>B</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Netsøger</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Open a browser</action> with the &URL; stored for the current &kab; "
"entry."
msgstr ""
"<action>Åbner en netsøger</action> med &URL;'en der er gemt for den "
"aktuelle &kab;-indgang."

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Search "
"Entries...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Søg i "
"indgange...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Search the database</action> for a particular entry."
msgstr "<action>Gennemsøg databasen</action> for en bestemt indgang."

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Enable all Messages</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Aktivér alle beskeder</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are some messages that might be accidentally disabled by the user, "
"such as one at start up informing him how to import his old &kde; 1 "
"addressbook. <action>Selecting this menu item makes all such messages "
"reappear. </action>"
msgstr ""
"Der er nogle beskeder der ved et tilfælde kan blive deaktiveret af "
"brugeren, såsom den ved opstart der informerer om hvordan man importerer "
"sin gamle &kde; 1 adressebog. <action>Valg af dette menupunkt får alle "
"sådanne beskeder frem igen. </action>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure this File...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Indstil denne fil...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Lets you configure some parameters of the current address "
"book</action>. At present the <guilabel>User fields</guilabel>"
" tab page does not function, but the <guilabel>Address types</guilabel> tab "
"page can be used to set up default address <guilabel>Address "
"types</guilabel> values."
msgstr ""
"<action>Lader dig indstille nogle parametre for den aktuelle "
"adressebog</action>. For øjeblikket virker "
"<guilabel>Brugerfelter</guilabel>-fanebladssiden ikke, men "
"<guilabel>Adressetyper</guilabel>"
"-fanebladssiden kan bruges til at indstille standardadresse "
"<guilabel>Adressetyper</guilabel>-værdier."

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Preferences for KDE Address "
"Book...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Redigér</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Indstillinger for KDE's "
"adressebog...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows you to set up some general &kab; settings."
msgstr "Lader dig lave noget generel &kab;-opsætning."

#: index.docbook:493
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>View</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Vis</guimenu>menuen"

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Business Card</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Vis</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Forretningskort</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show the normal card index view."
msgstr "Vis den normale kortindeks-visning."

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Editing</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Vis</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Redigering</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Change</action> the main &kab; window to allow the entry to be "
"edited."
msgstr "<action>Ændr</action> hoved-&kab;-vinduet så indgangen kan blive redigeret."

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Main Toolbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Vis</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Vis hoves-værktøjslinjen</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Show or hide the main toolbar</action>."
msgstr "<action>Vis eller skjul hoved-værktøjslinjen</action>."

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Entry Navigation "
"Toolbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Vis</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Vis "
"indgangsnavigerings-værktøjslinjen</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Show or hide the toolbar used to navigate through your "
"database</action>."
msgstr ""
"<action>Vis eller skjul værktøjslinjen der bruges til at navigere gennem "
"din database</action>."

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Entry Navigation List</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Vis</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Vis "
"indgangs-navigeringsliste</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Show or hide the entry list at the left side of &kab;'s "
"window.</action>."
msgstr ""
"<action>Vis eller skjul indgangslisten i venstre side af &kab;'s "
"vindue.</action>."

#: index.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Help</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Hjælpe</guimenu>menuen"

#: index.docbook:563
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "Spørgsmål og svar"

#: index.docbook:569
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where does &kab; store the address book?"
msgstr "Hvor gemmer &kab; adressebogen?"

#: index.docbook:572
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The default address book database is stored at "
"<filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kab/addressbook.kab</filename>, any new "
"databases that you have created will be stored wherever you put them."
msgstr ""
"Standardadressebogs-databasen gemmes i "
"<filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kab/addressbook.kab</filename>, og alle nye "
"databaser som du opretter gemmes der hvor du gemmer dem."

#: index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid "What configuration files does &kab; use?"
msgstr "Hvilke indstillingsfiler bruger &kab;?"

#: index.docbook:584
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The file <filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kab/kab.config</filename> holds your "
"&kab; <quote>preferences</quote> and the command strings for mail and talk."
msgstr ""
"Filen <filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kab/kab.config</filename> holder dine "
"&kab; <quote>indstillinger</quote> og kommandostrengene for e-mail og talk."

#: index.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>~/.kde/share/config/kabrc</filename> holds general &kab; "
"appearance parameters and a list of the most recently visited address books."
msgstr ""
"<filename>~/.kde/share/config/kabrc</filename> holder generelle "
"&kab;-udseende parametre og en liste af de nyligst besøgte adressebøger."

#: index.docbook:592
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Don't modify these files unless you really know what you are doing (and have "
"made a back up)."
msgstr ""
"Ændr ikke disse filer med mindre du virkelig ved hvad du foretager dig (og "
"har lavet en sikkerhedskopi. Rigtige mænd laver ikke sikkerhedskopier, men "
"de græder meget)."

